description: Use Gradle Version Catalogs; never hardcode dependency versions
globs: "**/*.{gradle.kts,toml}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Modern Dependency Management (Version Catalogs)

- Do NOT hardcode dependency strings or version numbers directly inside `build.gradle.kts` files.
- Always use the Gradle Version Catalog system (`gradle/libs.versions.toml`).
- If a new library is required, provide the exact modification for `libs.versions.toml` under `[versions]`, `[libraries]`, and `[plugins]`, followed by the correct `implementation(libs....)` syntax for the `build.gradle.kts` file.
